<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`atomicWrite` lands each projected file through a same-directory temp, fsync and rename, counting the first write after a change. `diskCarrierText` reads what stands on disk; `renderedOutput` resolves a pointer's bytes and names the text a render stands as. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

